WEBVTT

NOTE Flamingo Balance: Bop at Home movement break. Activity footage starts at 4.000 s.

title
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.900
[Title] Futures Friends. Movement break: Flamingo Balance. Move along with Bop.

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.840
<v Bop>Hi, friends! I'm Bop.

2
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.840
<v Bop>Let's be flamingos!

3
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.840
<v Bop>It's Flamingo Balance!

4
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.840
<v Bop>Stand tall, and hold the wall or a grown-up's hand.

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.840
<v Bop>Lift one foot a little...
and count with me!

6
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:28.840
<v Bop>One... two... three... four... five!

7
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.840
<v Bop>Wobbles are welcome!

8
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.840
<v Bop>Ready for the other foot?

9
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.840
<v Bop>Now the other foot!

10
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.840
<v Bop>Lift it a little... and count with me!

11
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:47.840
<v Bop>One... two... three... four... five!

12
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.840
<v Bop>Wobbles are welcome!

13
00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.840
<v Bop>Now be a flamingo with a wing!

14
00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.840
<v Bop>Stretch your other arm out wide.

15
00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:03.350
<v Bop>One... two... three... four... five!

endcard
00:01:04.692 --> 00:01:08.692
[End card] Great balancing, friends! Learn. Move. Explore. Belong.
A Futures Friends movement break.
